#: ../../dev/architecture.md:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../dev/architecture.md:7
msgid ""
"`rescript-tauri` is a pnpm-workspace monorepo of ReScript binding "
"packages around Tauri 2.x's official JS SDK (`@tauri-apps/api`). The core"
" package, `@rescript-tauri/core`, exposes the entire upstream public API "
"surface (IPC, Event, Window, Webview, Menu, Tray, etc.) with idiomatic "
"ReScript types."
msgstr ""

